cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VBF in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VBF: vectorial Boolean function analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: Siqueira
    given-names: Tiago Faustino de
    affiliation: "Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina"
repository-code: "https://github.com/siqueiratf/VBF.jl"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >
  A Julia library for analysing vectorial Boolean functions, focused on APN
  functions and the linear, affine, EA, and CCZ equivalence hierarchy. It
  reimplements, in native Julia, the algorithmic content of the sboxU
  cryptanalysis stack and several satellite projects, and ships a curated
  S-box catalogue with provenance and paper-reproduction scripts.
keywords:
  - APN functions
  - vectorial Boolean functions
  - CCZ equivalence
  - reproducibility
  - Julia
